{
  "bridge_text": "寒风轻轻吹过树梢，正如你所好奇的，那嗡嗡声里藏着古老的秘密，莉娜紧了紧红色的斗篷，决定走进那棵巨大的空心树中一探究竟。",
  "resume_strategy": "restart",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "莉娜居住的那个羊毛灰色的村庄边缘，矗立着一棵比教堂还要高大的空心树。每当冬夜降临，树皮中便会传出低沉的嗡嗡声，大人们总是警告孩子们离那儿远点。可就在那个夜晚，当祖母还没讲完故事就沉沉睡去时，莉娜披上红色羊毛大衣，穿过结霜的田野，决心去听听那嗡嗡声到底在诉说着什么。"
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s1"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "While the fox holds his secrets close, the weight of his words lingers in the air between them. Lina stands her ground, ready to see what lies beneath the roots.",
  "resume_strategy": "continue",
  "replacement_segments": [
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Lina stood firm, her eyes meeting his weary gaze. She knew there was more to the humming than a simple warning, and she wasn't about to turn back now. Mosk let out a soft sigh, his ears drooping as he realized she was as stubborn as the winter frost."
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Mosk pointed at the door, but Lina didn't move. Instead, she reached into her pocket and pulled out the last apple of the season. She set it on the step between them and said, this is for the trouble of walking me down. Mosk stared at the apple for a long time. Then he stood up, tied his vest, and stepped onto the first stair without a word."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s2"
}

{
